@lang en
IMPORT `vn11-art03-benefits`

-- Manulife Vietnam term life product terms, row VN-11: Article 4 (refusal to take up the
-- insurance, the free-look period), Article 5 (premiums and the grace period), Article 6 (the
-- currency) and Article 7 (residence, travel and occupation).
--
-- THE CLOCK OF THE REGULATIVE RULES IS CALENDAR DAYS, and only this comment says so: `WITHIN`
-- takes a bare number. Each #TRACE in vn11-tests.l4 starts AT 0 on the day the period counts from
-- (the day the contract was received, or the due date).
--
-- In the rendering this module quotes, the text of Art 5 is split by the two-column layout: its
-- heading is at src:207-208, its first sentence starts at src:212-213 and goes on at src:147-150,
-- its middle is src:151-169 and its last sentence is src:175-179. Art 6's heading is at src:183
-- and its text at src:197-199. The PDF page (page 2) shows them in that order.

§ `Article 4 — Refusal to take up the insurance`

§§ `Art 4 — the 14 days`

-- src:186 | hiểm, nếu có yêu cầu bằng văn bản gửi tới Công
-- src:187 | ty trong vòng 14 (mười bốn) ngày sau khi Bên
-- "trong vòng 14 (mười bốn) ngày sau khi ... nhận được": calendar days, the day of receipt not
-- counted, the 14th day after it the last (fork F2). "yêu cầu bằng văn bản gửi tới Công ty" is
-- read as the day the request was sent (fork F12).
-- Law 08/2022/QH15 Art 35 gives 21 days for a contract longer than a year (LAW fork L1).
@ref Art 4, src:185-188
GIVEN `the day sent`     IS A DATE
      `the day received` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 4 — a request sent on` `the day sent` `is in time for a contract received on` `the day received` MEANS
        `the day sent` AT LEAST `the day received`
    AND `the day sent` AT MOST  `the day received` PLUS 14

§§ `Art 4 — the refund`

-- src:189 | Trong trường hợp này, Công ty sẽ hoàn lại phí bảo
-- src:190 | hiểm đã đóng trừ đi các khoản chi phí y tế Công
-- src:193 | hoá đơn thu phí bảo hiểm cho Công ty, nếu không,
-- src:194 | Công ty sẽ không hoàn trả lại bất cứ một khoản
-- The refund is the premium paid less the medical expenses the Company paid in assessing the risk,
-- not taken below nil (fork F10). It is owed only once the premium receipts are returned, and
-- nothing is refunded if they are not; no period is set for returning them (finding 12).
@ref Art 4, src:185-195
GIVEN `the request` IS A `A request to cancel under Art 4`
GIVETH A `The result of a request to cancel under Art 4`
`Art 4 — the result of the request to cancel` `the request` MEANS
  BRANCH
    IF NOT `Art 4 — a request sent on` (`the request`'s `date the written request was sent`) `is in time for a contract received on` (`the request`'s `date the contract was received`)
        THEN `not cancelled under Art 4: the request was late`
    IF NOT `the request`'s `premium receipts returned to the Company`
        THEN `cancelled, and nothing is refunded`
    OTHERWISE `cancelled, and the premium is refunded` (max 0 (`the request`'s `premium paid` MINUS `the request`'s `medical expenses the Company paid in assessing the risk`))

§§ `Art 4 — the same, as a permission with its consequences`

-- A MAY: an unexercised permission lapses with no breach. Neither the return of the receipts nor
-- the refund has a period in the document, so neither carries a WITHIN (phrasebook 5.9).
@ref Art 4, src:185-195
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party` `An act`
`Art 4 — the policyholder may cancel within 14 days of receiving the contract` MEANS
    PARTY  `the policyholder`
    MAY    `send the Company a written request to cancel`
    WITHIN 14
    HENCE  PARTY `the policyholder`
           MUST  `return the premium receipts to the Company`
           HENCE PARTY `the Company`
                 MUST  `refund the premium paid, less the medical expenses of assessing the risk`
                 HENCE FULFILLED

§ `Article 5 — Payment of premiums and the grace period`

§§ `Art 5 — the duty to pay`

-- src:212 | Bên mua bảo hiểm có nghĩa vụ đóng các khoản
-- src:213 | phí bảo hiểm trong thời gian Người được bảo
-- src:147 | hiểm còn sống theo “Kế hoạch đóng phí bảo
-- src:175 | Bên mua bảo hiểm phải đóng phí bảo hiểm vào
-- src:176 | hoặc trước ngày đến kỳ đóng phí ghi trong Trang
-- src:151 | Sau khi đóng phí bảo hiểm lần đầu, việc không
-- src:152 | đóng cho Công ty hoặc cho đại lý của Công ty phí
-- A premium counts as paid only when paid, in full, to the Company or to its agent.
@ref Art 5, src:151-154
GIVEN `the payee` IS A `A payee of the premium`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 5 — paid to the Company or to its agent` `the payee` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the payee`
    WHEN `paid to the Company`             THEN TRUE
    WHEN `paid to an agent of the Company` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `paid to someone else`            THEN FALSE

@ref Art 5, src:151-154, 159-161
GIVEN `the instalment` IS A `A premium instalment`
      `the day`        IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 5 — the instalment was paid in full, to the Company or its agent, by` `the instalment` `the day` MEANS
        `Art 5 — paid to the Company or to its agent` (`the instalment`'s `paid to`)
    AND `paid in full on or before the day`
    WHERE
        `paid in full on or before the day` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the instalment`'s `paid in full on`
            WHEN NOTHING                 THEN FALSE
            WHEN JUST `the payment date` THEN `the payment date` AT MOST `the day`

-- "Sau khi đóng phí bảo hiểm lần đầu": the rule about non-payment starts after the first premium.
-- The document does not say whether the contract is in force before the first premium is paid.
@ref Art 5, src:151-154
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Art 5 does not say whether the contract is in force before the first premium is paid` MEANS
    REFUSE "Art 5 does not say whether the contract is in force before the first premium is paid"

@ref Art 5, src:151-154
GIVEN `the instalment` IS A `A premium instalment`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 5 — the instalment is deemed not paid` `the instalment` MEANS
    NOT `Art 5 — the instalment was paid in full, to the Company or its agent, by` `the instalment` (`the instalment`'s `due date`)

§§ `Art 5 — the grace period, and lapse`

-- src:155 | Thời gian gia hạn đóng phí bảo hiểm là 60 (sáu
-- src:156 | mươi) ngày kể từ ngày đến kỳ đóng phí bảo hiểm.
-- Sixty calendar days from the due date: the due date is day 0, day 60 is the last day of grace
-- (fork F2). The contract stays in force throughout.
@ref Art 5, src:155-158
GIVEN `the instalment` IS A `A premium instalment`
GIVETH A DATE
`Art 5 — the last day of the grace period for` `the instalment` MEANS
    `the instalment`'s `due date` PLUS 60

-- src:160 | đủ khi hết thời gian gia hạn đóng phí bảo hiểm thì
-- src:161 | Hợp đồng bảo hiểm sẽ mất hiệu lực và chấm dứt.
-- "sẽ mất hiệu lực và chấm dứt": a premium not paid in full by the last day of grace lapses and
-- terminates the contract from the day after it (Art 18(i), src:403-404).
@ref Art 5, src:159-161; Art 18(i), src:403-404
GIVEN `the day`        IS A DATE
      `the instalment` IS A `A premium instalment`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 5 — the contract had lapsed by` `the day` `for non-payment of` `the instalment` MEANS
        `the day` GREATER THAN `Art 5 — the last day of the grace period for` `the instalment`
    AND NOT `Art 5 — the instalment was paid in full, to the Company or its agent, by` `the instalment` (`Art 5 — the last day of the grace period for` `the instalment`)

§§ `Art 5 — the same, as a duty with a grace period`

-- The grace period is a second deadline, not a new due date (phrasebook 4.11). Law 08/2022/QH15
-- Art 37(4) bars the insurer from suing for the premium (LAW fork L5), so the only consequence this
-- rule reports is lapse.
@ref Art 5, src:147-161, 175-179, 212-213
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party` `An act`
`Art 5 — the policyholder must pay each premium on or before its due date` MEANS
    PARTY  `the policyholder`
    MUST   `pay the premium due, to the Company or its agent`
    WITHIN 0
    HENCE  FULFILLED
    LEST   PARTY  `the policyholder`
           MUST   `pay the premium due, to the Company or its agent`
           WITHIN 60
           HENCE  FULFILLED
           LEST   BREACH BY `the policyholder`
                  BECAUSE "Art 5: the premium due was not paid in full by the last day of the 60-day grace period, so the contract lapses and terminates"

§§ `Art 5 — premiums not yet due when a death is claimed`

-- src:167 | hiểm đóng những khoản phí tiếp theo của năm đó
-- src:168 | chưa đến hạn phải trả theo định kỳ nửa năm, hàng
-- src:169 | quý hoặc hàng tháng.
-- Read with Art 3(a)(iii) ("Tất cả các khoản phí bảo hiểm chưa đóng"): the premiums deducted as
-- unpaid are those that had fallen due; the rest of the year's premium under a half-yearly,
-- quarterly or monthly mode, which the Company "will not require", is not deducted (fork F7).
@ref Art 5, src:162-169; Art 3(a)(iii), src:93
GIVEN `the record` IS A `The premium record`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Art 5 — the premiums deducted from the death benefit as unpaid` `the record` MEANS
    `the record`'s `premiums due and unpaid at the death`

§ `Article 6 — The currency of payment`
-- src:197 | Tất cả các khoản tiền phải đóng cho Công ty hoặc
-- src:198 | do Công ty trả sẽ được thanh toán bằng đồng Việt
-- Every amount in this encoding is in Vietnamese dong, as a bare NUMBER.
@ref Art 6, src:197-199
GIVETH A STRING
`Art 6 — the currency of every payment to or by the Company` MEANS "Vietnamese dong (VND)"

§ `Article 7 — Residence, travel and occupation`
-- src:201 | Vào ngày được cấp Hợp đồng bảo hiểm, Người
-- src:202 | được bảo hiểm phải cư trú tại nước Cộng hòa Xã
-- src:203 | hội chủ nghĩa Việt Nam. Ngoài ra, Hợp đồng bảo
-- src:204 | hiểm không bị ràng buộc bởi các hạn chế về cư
-- src:205 | trú, đi lại và nghề nghiệp.
-- The residence condition is Art 1.3's again, on the same field. The second sentence is encoded by
-- absence: no rule reads where the insured lived, travelled or worked after the issue date, and a
-- test (vn11-tests.l4) checks that a death abroad in a dangerous occupation is covered.
@ref Art 7, src:201-205
GIVEN `the insured person` IS A `The insured`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 7 — the insured resided in Vietnam on the day the contract was issued` `the insured person` MEANS
    `the insured person`'s `resided in Vietnam on the issue date`
